        "language": "english",
        "review": "A glimpse of reality from a red pill factory you'd prefer to drink. No blue pills included.\nA simple game with simple sprites and a simple story. It looks simple enough to resonate and awaken idealist's soul. Game authors being brilliant in their decisions surely played us, the players, for absolute fools with these hard choices and rogue AI fleur. You'd think about things that don't really matter only to get a heartbreak and the true philosophical intoxication at the end, so you'd definitely feel more awake and beaten. Also, if you're an egoist and everybody tells you that you need to give more, to be more compassionate and all that nonsense, and you really want to win this girl or maybe just want to become someone else, then you shall give this game a try - it packs a nudge for the dollar. Just make sure you have your time and place to swallow. Good work on music.",
